ross dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion System \u2013 Tap into the shattered power of broken altars to forge your ultimate support allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/c37c9893255c9ba605c7fd5a7f6fba33.poster.avif?t=1756536392\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/c37c9893255c9ba605c7fd5a7f6fba33.webm?t=1756536392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/c37c9893255c9ba605c7fd5a7f6fba33.mp4?t=1756536392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Epic Boss Fights &amp; Branching Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against the Dimension Reaper, Kaos, a villain who manipulates rifts to devour entire worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-phase Boss Battles \u2013 Kaos summons echoes of fallen worlds and uses powerful skills like rift teleportation and energy siphoning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moral Choices, Multiple Endings \u2013 After defeating Kaos, your final decision\u2014to destroy or preserve the energy core\u2014will shape the fate of all worlds: will you revive the multiverse, seize power, or trap reality in an endless loop?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/0b0dfa9f90b13ffe5069f4a547f8b561.poster.avif?t=1756536392\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/0b0dfa9f90b13ffe5069f4a547f8b561.webm?t=1756536392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps